WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.507
Reassuring wording can hide an unlimited promise You have

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.877
seen a workable agreement Now inspect one that only

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:12.824
sounds complete A phrase such as all duties as

00:00:12.863 --> 00:00:16.521
required may sound cooperative but leave work authority and

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:21.219
availability unclear We will identify these gaps and replace

00:00:21.245 --> 00:00:24.455
vague promises with defined conditions and named owners
